<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Basic HTML Page</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Welcome to My Web Page</h1>
    <h2>HTML Basics</h2>
    <h3>Text Formatting</h3>

    <p>
        HTML stands for <b>HyperText Markup Language</b>.  
        It is used to <i>create web pages</i> and web applications.
    </p>

    <p>
        HTML allows us to format text using tags like
        <u>underline</u>, <b>bold</b>, and <i>italic</i>.
    </p>

    <p>
        This text is <strong>important</strong> and this is
        <em>emphasized</em> text.
    </p>

    <p>
        Example of <mark>highlighted text</mark>,
        <small>small text</small>,
        H<sub>2</sub>O (subscript),
        x<sup>2</sup> (superscript).
    </p>

</body>
</html>
